contrie_extract: description  +Each plan caps one request's credits, rendering included (Free 3, Builder 5, Pro 17); an answer above the cap is refused and costs 0.
contrie_read: description  -The call +A successful read -credit before any requested rendering. +credit; a failed one costs 0.
contrie_watch: description, inputSchema  +Plans cap active monitors (Free 3, Builder 25, Pro 100). Creation is not idempotent: if a response is lost, list your monitors before retrying, or the retry creates a second monitor that also charges.  parameters: -60); +60, minimum 15, maximum 10,080);
